Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.05,title2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(215,270)\fad(400,0)}勇者芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:15.58,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何ページもついやして　綴られた僕らの気分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:22.83,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうしてか一行の　空白をうめられない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:30.96,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}押し花の栞はさんで　君と転がす使い捨ての自転車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:38.55,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忘れかけの煉瓦を　積み上げた場所にゆこう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:43.79,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}海を見渡す坂をかけのぼって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.34,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こわいくらいに青い空と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:56.09,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手にサイダー　左手はずっと君をさがしている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:01:03.84,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そうやって“今”は僕の方へ　問いつめることもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:10.75,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}まだ二人はすぐそこにいるのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:16.72,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「どうかまた会えますように」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:26.55,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんて　どうかしてるみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:15.58,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}使用好幾頁　填補了我們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:22.83,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}卻彌補不了那唯一的一行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:30.96,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}夾上乾花書籤　和你乘上騎一次就扔的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:38.55,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}前往用幾乎遺忘的磚頭堆積起來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:43.79,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}爬上望得見海的小坡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.34,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}頭上是湛藍的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:56.09,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手是碳酸飲料　左手一直在尋求著你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:01:03.84,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}現在呢　你也不會再追問我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:10.75,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}兩個人明明還在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:16.72,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「而我卻祈願能再次相遇」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:26.55,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可能是我的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:31.56,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}出会いは　ふっとした　瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:35.17,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}帰り道の交差点で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:40.97,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}声をかけてくれたね「一緒に帰ろう」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:47.50,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　花火が夜空　きれいに咲いて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:49.65,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}ちょっとセツナク
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:56.32,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　風が時間とともに　流れる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:22:03.73,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}嬉しくって　楽しくって　冒険も　いろいろしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:10.72,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}二人の　秘密の　基地の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:14.70,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.90,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望を忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:25.00,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:27.05,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君が最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.09,0:22:32.23,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}心から「ありがとう」叫んでたこと　知ってたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:35.97,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}涙をこらえて　笑顔でさようなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:39.23,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}せつないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.57,0:22:48.07,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:31.56,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}邂逅是瞬間的巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:35.17,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在回家的路口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:40.97,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}你對我說「一起回去吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:47.50,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊　煙花在夜空裡絢麗地綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:49.65,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:56.32,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊　風隨著時間一起流動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:22:03.73,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}開心的　愉快的冒險也經歷過很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:10.72,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在兩個人的秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:14.70,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天　將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.90,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:25.00,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:27.05,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我知道你自始至終
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.09,0:22:32.23,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}都在心裡喊「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:35.97,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}強忍淚水　笑著說再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:39.23,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.57,0:22:48.07,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請實現我的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不就成了還魂似的了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了  芽間為了實現願望而還魂回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我覺得這只是我看到的幻想…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻想？也就是Fantasy？  好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她現在也在這兒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…現在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間是我啊  在這嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡  芽間  露個臉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然趁勢就把芽間的事說出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到這些他能這麼乖乖的接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊  我看不見她…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說這只是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太果然太強了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個秘密基地你在用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是在日本的時候用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  那些紅色的標記就是去過的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看世界上各種各樣的地方吶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用打工掙的錢去旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有時間去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前一陣子去了東南亞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  越南的姑娘真可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太真強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前那麼小的個子  現在長這麼壯了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…沒有變呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？  變了不少哦  Jungle Cruise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別鬧了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑題了跑題了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間的願望是吧  有過什麼約定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  記不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是不是曾說過想要仁太的「是的哦」的簽名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「是的哦」哪至於變鬼還要來取啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道會是那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的栗丸怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去後給你吃酸奶哦酸奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳴子你真的去了宿海家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去照顧家裡蹲真是倒楣透了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是偶爾不是有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼沒精神 早上很辛苦什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也偶爾會…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,經常有…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是哦  但我不想被視為那陰沉的傢伙的同類
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在絕對在拿鳴子想色色的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女人怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是王大附屬的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真煩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴…鶴見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  你忘東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候就不要管了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和綠高的女生說話的情形要是被誰看見的話太丟臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是什麼意思  等下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家好心給你送來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}你什麼時候這麼高傲了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:06:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴  鶴子  不能吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}以前明明那麼低調
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倒是沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前就容易被別人左右
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和剛才你身邊那些輕浮的女人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輕浮？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前明明一直在模仿本間芽衣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死…死人的名字別隨便掛在嘴邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出自自己之口讓自己痛苦  真沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想變得和芽間一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  仁太是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡芽間的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我沒有那樣挑動他的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰…誰會喜歡這醜八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等仁太  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而後…變成了那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.09,0:08:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青蛙在叫了就～回～家了  青蛙在叫了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…應該回哪裡去呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問您要找什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈  布袋妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人要買你有意見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布袋妖怪哪一作  蛋白石？  綠寶石？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈？布袋妖怪金  那是哪一年出的老古董了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之有賣的話就趕緊拿出來  趕緊賣給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  稀有布袋怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對對  芽間超想要的不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是一直沒能入手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像說過Bilbilder什麼的呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4571日元
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5年前出的遊戲定價賣是不是太黑了點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先申明了  這可是良心價啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個已經絕版了  定價賣算便宜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事！謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:09:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來仁太君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天剛好從現場弄回來了很不錯的盤子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以吃烤肉大餐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  沒食慾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  這算什麼真不可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼玩來著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始三隻裡面選一隻…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間還沒有回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的壓力具現化的幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.22,0:10:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來就不該存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你…仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗…久川
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像以前那樣叫噗噗就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熱情點嘛  阿雪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這叫法是第一次聽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在意  對了雪集知道嗎  仁太身邊芽間還魂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙到現在還…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…宿海怎麼說芽間的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太他呢  好久不見了還是一如既往那麼強
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海怎麼說芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻聽？還是幻想來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不太懂  芽間好像說什麼請實現我的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間你回來…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…洗什麼澡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸也在的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  總覺得洗澡除了涼颼颼外別無感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:13:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間討厭這樣  仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呀  對成長後的自己稍微注意一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然某部分還沒怎麼成長的說…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某部分？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之你先穿上衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  這少年好像哪裡見過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好！好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  難道是噗噗？  好高！成長期真可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和朋友交換？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  用連接線交換布袋妖怪後就可以獲得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  大叔  肉好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是昨晚的剩菜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大叔我去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  我全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間也說了「要大家一起才能實現」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害噗噗  怎麼想起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說我也看見幻聽了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻聽不是看的是聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣啊  那再買一個布袋妖怪的遊戲卡就…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外  有布袋妖怪的人其他還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然好可愛呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候最討厭自己的捲髮和眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔順長髮的芽間…被仁太喜愛的芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴  貼紙貼成成對的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看這個可愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給安鳴一個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜歡芽間…卻也很討厭…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.36,0:15:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳴子  有空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真能使喚人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  安鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思  連我也要玩布袋妖怪？開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係偶爾一玩  回歸童心  是吧仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  眼鏡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦  有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請喝茶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩您了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來你倆來家裡還真是懷念呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚鳴子做的果凍吃嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴的果凍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別再叫這名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之稀有布袋妖怪可是芽間的願望哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋別說這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  沒…芽間怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…在夢中出現了還是該怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間她…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布袋妖怪在…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這邊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  那是Love&Perry的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是牛王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  牛王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼一直不過來這邊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為芽間在的話媽媽和安鳴都會變得傷心的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這邊坐著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bo☆BoBo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在這麼個小遊戲上還貼名字…你真是規矩的人吶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.23,0:17:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔了好久重新看Bo☆BoBo真是有意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭不能相信  為什麼沒有波伊特
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為稀有布袋妖怪不是要把波伊扎和鋼格爾交換…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,領域內沒有波伊扎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得讓波伊特進化  我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴果然沒有變
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:18:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對大家很好  還有很多遊戲漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是和那時候一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種氣氛總覺得好久不見了  真開心…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.77,0:18:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了  波伊扎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太漂亮了  仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你了  安城
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼  就當打發時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫你的報酬有嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要來上學哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣了…？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還…還有一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來把連接線接上…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了這樣就可以和朋友交換了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安城？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布袋妖怪到手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…呃？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  這下芽間也會高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願望好像不是這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好事有許多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太安鳴還有噗噗又成了好朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不當自己事啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當心摔倒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒～關～係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間最近全是快樂的事～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的說哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間最近全是快樂的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也許久沒這麼快樂了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的精神創傷雖然還沒有消失的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但既然有明天的話  道歉就算慢慢來也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始這樣想了
